### Health Check
# Returns OK if the server is healthy
GET http://localhost:8080/api/healthz HTTP/1.1

### Get Admin Metrics
# Returns an HTML page showing how many times the file server has been visited
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/metrics HTTP/1.1

### Reset Metrics
# Resets the file server visit counter to 0
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/reset HTTP/1.1

### Serve Static File (index.html)
# Serves the index.html file from the root directory via the /app/ path
GET http://localhost:8080/app/ HTTP/1.1

### Serve Static File (LICENSE)
# Serves the LICENSE file from the root directory via the /app/ path
GET http://localhost:8080/app/LICENSE HTTP/1.1

### Serve Static File (README.md)
# Serves the README.md file from the root directory via the /app/ path
GET http://localhost:8080/app/README.md HTTP/1.1

### Serve Static File (assets directory listing)
# Serves the assets directory contents via the /app/ path
GET http://localhost:8080/app/assets/ HTTP/1.1
